DAY 1 — AI SYSTEM ADMINISTRATOR LAB
RHEL • Ubuntu • Windows Server • Active Directory
Today we are going to install the tools, create the lab, connect an AI model to Python, connect Python to Ubuntu through SSH, and build your first AI SysAdmin assistant.
The goal is not to cover everything today. The goal is to finish Day 1 with a working foundation.
